OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of incitement
OL,5,
OL,6,FTanzania's main opposition leader,
OL,7,FTundu Lissu, has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fincitement in a case that has raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about political freedoms in
OL,10,Fthe East African country.
OL,12,FA panel of three judges at the High
OL,13,FCourt in Dar es Salaam acquitted him of
OL,14,Fthe more serious charge of treason,
OL,15,Fsaying prosecutors had failed to prove
OL,16,Fa key element of the charge.
OL,18,FThe 58-year-old, who has been detained
OL,19,Fsince April last year, was charged over
OL,20,Fremarks he made while campaigning for
OL,21,Felectoral reforms ahead of the disputed
OL,22,F2025 general election.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
