OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of incitement
OL,5,
OL,6,FLissu, who leads the opposition Chadema
OL,7,Fparty, has consistently denied the
OL,8,Fcharges, describing the prosecution as
OL,9,Fpolitically motivated.
